<title>FRANCE: France to hold food aid tenders on May 13 - ONIC.</title>
<headline>France to hold food aid tenders on May 13 - ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will hold a tender on May 13 to sell 4,000 tonnes of soft wheat grain to Nepal, 4,000 tonnes of soft wheat grain to Georgia and 730 tonnes of soft wheat flour to Sri Lanka as food aid, national grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The wheat and the flour are for shipment in bags between May 30 and June 15.</p>
<p>France will also hold a tender on May 13 for the supply of 5,110 tonnes of soft wheat flour under the U.N. Relief and Works Agency for Palestinian refugees in the near East (UNRWA) programme.</p>
<p>The flour will be shipped in bags to Jordan, Lebanon, Syria and Israel. Four lots are for shipment between May 30 and June 15 and one lot between August 23 and September 6.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
